# Fifteen days of tide at Bodø in a minute: hours 3 to 363 of the run, 6 model hours
# a second (an M2 cycle every 2 s). Mesh km from the case's origin (67.275°N
# 14.125°E): the Bodø gauge at 11.5, 1.5, Landegode about 8, 15. The views look
# south-east, over the sea to the Saltfjord's mountains and away from the sun's glint
# (from the south-west). See viz/src/record.rs for the format; scripts/video/bodo.toml.
# video_s  model_h  kind   X_km  Y_km  DIST_km  BEARING  PITCH
0          3        orbit  1     -1    50       150      60
14         87       orbit  4     2     34       140      48
28         171      orbit  10    0     16       140      32
40         243      orbit  9     2     20       130      36
52         315      orbit  3     5     30       125      44
60         363      orbit  1     -1    50       150      60
